==Trivia==
A small [[snow Pikachu]] is featured in this card's illustration.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Snorunt|47}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Icicle''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Snorunt|37}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

